OL,3,ABrazilians voting to choose their next
OL,4,Apresident in election run-off
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrazilians are voting to choose their
OL,7,Fnew president in a closely fought
OL,8,Frun-off election - polls will close at
OL,9,F17:00 local time (20:00 GMT)
OL,11,FIt is the second round of voting after
OL,12,Fright-wing senator Flavio Bolsonaro won
OL,13,Fthe first round earlier this month -
OL,14,Fbeating incumbent President Luiz Inacio
OL,15,FLula da Silva, known widely as Lula
OL,17,FBolsonaro is the son of former
OL,18,Fpresident Jair Bolsonaro, who was given
OL,19,Fa 27-year prison sentence for a failed
OL,20,Fcoup after losing the 2022 election,
OL,21,Fand is now under house arrest
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
