OL,3,ABrazilians voting to choose their next
OL,4,Apresident in election run-off
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlavio Bolsonaro secured 47% of the
OL,7,Fvote to Lula's 45% in the first round,
OL,8,Fexceeding expectations but falling
OL,9,Fshort of an outright majority
OL,11,FArriving at a polling station in Rio de
OL,12,FJaneiro early this morning, Bolsonaro
OL,13,Ftold reporters the "time has come for
OL,14,Freal change"
OL,16,FMeanwhile, Lula greeted supporters
OL,17,Foutside a polling station as he cast
OL,18,Fhis vote in Sao Bernardo do Campo
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
